                <span class="skill-name">Lycoris Bloom</span>
                <span class="skill-badge badge-skill">Skill 4</span>
              </div>
              <p class="skill-desc">
                Buffs the ally with the <span class="highlight">highest Energy</span>, increasing their ATK by 15% and restoring 50 Energy per second to them for 5s.
              </p>
              <div class="skill-upgrade-block">
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv2</span><span class="upgrade-text">Grants 20% DMG RED to the target.</span></div>
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv3</span><span class="upgrade-text">Increases ATK bonus to 30%.</span></div>
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv4</span><span class="upgrade-text">Restores 80 Energy per second.</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="skill-note">
                The hypercarry enabler. At Lv3 the ATK bonus doubles from 15% to 30%; Lv4 raises Energy regen from 50 to 80 per second. Build Energy-focused items on your primary DPS to guarantee they consistently receive this buff.
              </div>
