              <li><strong>3. Lycoris Bloom</strong> -- ATK% doubling at Lv3 is a major jump in carry support value</li>
              <li><strong>4. Stone of Three Fates</strong> -- CD reduction at Lv3 is the key breakpoint</li>
              <li><strong>5. Waters of Oblivion</strong> -- Lowest priority; upgrade when above skills are maxed</li>
