              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge rating-ss">SS</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Revival + CC cleanse = unmatched sustain in prolonged PVE</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rating-card">
              <div class="rating-mode">Tower / Progression</div>
              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge rating-ss">SS</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Multi-stage fights reward the revival loop; untargetability blocks burst shutdowns</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rating-card">
