          <div class="mechanic-box" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <div class="mechanic-label">Skill Upgrade Priority</div>
            <ul class="mechanic-list">
              <li><strong>1. Realm of Frost (Passive)</strong> -- Energy restoration at Lv3 is the foundation of the entire control loop</li>
              <li><strong>2. Drifting Vortex (Ultimate)</strong> -- Multi-hit stacking at Lv3 transforms damage output; main damage source</li>
