              <div class="rating-mode">Tower / Progression</div>
              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge rating-s">S</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Multi-stage fights reward snowball potential; ATK stacks and Energy carry momentum between waves</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rating-card">
              <div class="rating-mode">Boss Fights</div>
              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge rating-a">A</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Single-target limits passive proc frequency; DoT and ramp-up scaling still contribute, but loop is slower to start</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rating-card">
              <div class="rating-mode">PVP</div>
              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge rating-s">S</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Strong in control-heavy meta; hard-countered by Cleanse and CC-Immunity compositions</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:12px; font-style:italic; text-align:center;">* All ratings theoretical -- based on skill mechanics and CN community meta analysis. No global server data available (hero not yet released).</p>
        </section>

        <!-- POSITIONING -->
        <section class="section" id="skadi-positioning">
          <div class="section-title">Recommended Positioning</div>
          <div class="pos-grid">
            <div class="pos-card">
              <div class="pos-mode">Backline -- Carry Position</div>
              <p>Skadi needs setup time before her loop activates. She must survive the opening exchange to begin stacking ATK from her Relic and generating Energy from Realm of Frost. Place her in position 4 or 5 -- as far from enemy frontline threats as possible.</p>
              <p>Her Relic Lv2 pseudo-revival provides insurance, but burning it early to survive poor positioning wastes the DPS extension it provides in late-fight.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pos-card">
              <div class="pos-mode">Formation Structure</div>
              <p><strong>Front:</strong> Tank or Taunt unit (Momus) -- absorbs initial burst and establishes the first control state via taunt.</p>
              <p><strong>Mid:</strong> CC units (Poseidon, Pan) -- lock down and group enemies with layered AoE crowd control to maximize Realm of Frost triggers.</p>
              <p><strong>Back:</strong> Skadi + secondary support or burst DPS. Skadi must not be the first unit engaged. The team's job is to create a CC-rich environment before Skadi's Ultimate activates.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- COMPS -->
