          <div class="overview-card">
            <p>Jiutian Xuannv is a <strong>Legendary Archer</strong> of the <strong>Clubs faction</strong> whose kit centers on a dual-stance system that reads the battlefield and adapts. She is not a simple burst DPS -- instead she operates as a <em>board-control archer</em> who toggles between <span class="highlight">Execute stance</span> (focused single-target pressure with stacking ATK) and <span class="highlight">Yield stance</span> (weakest-target cleanup) depending on the unit-count state.</p>
            <p>Her Ultimate functions as a state manager, not a nuke. Her passive system designates frontline and backline allies as chess pieces, granting damage bonus and damage reduction respectively. Her active skill disrupts enemy energy cycles while regenerating her own. Her defensive passive converts incoming damage into a counter-attack burst via the Taiji Formation.</p>
            <p>The CN community describes her as a strong card for Clubs Tower (梅花塔), push content, and high-damage ranking scenarios -- but notes she is <em>team-dependent</em> and more investment-sensitive than simpler carries. Played correctly, she can exceed comparable archers in specific high-damage setups. Played blindly, she underperforms.</p>
            <p class="note-muted">Guide data sourced from CN community posts and official skill previews on TapTap CN (不朽箴言). Released on CN server March 6, 2026. Numerical stats not yet available.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- LORE -->
        <section class="section" id="jiutian-lore">
