            </div>
            <div class="rating-card">
              <div class="rating-mode">PVP</div>
              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge rating-a">A</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Tools exist but CN data currently prioritizes PvE; position-dependent</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rating-card">
              <div class="rating-mode">Early Game</div>
              <div class="rating-cell"><span class="rating-badge rating-a">A</span></div>
              <div class="rating-desc">Playable without max investment but noticeably team-dependent</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:12px; font-style:italic; text-align:center;">* Ratings based on CN TapTap community posts and official skill data for 不朽箴言. Released March 6, 2026 on CN server. Final global ratings subject to revision.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- POSITIONING -->
        <section class="section" id="jiutian-positioning">
          <div class="section-title">Recommended Positioning</div>
          <div class="pos-grid">
            <div class="pos-card">
              <div class="pos-mode">Backline -- Mandatory</div>
              <p>Jiutian Xuannv must occupy the rearmost position to receive the Black piece designation from Swift Control, Slow Response. In this slot she gains increased damage dealt -- directly amplifying her Execute stance ramp, Tactical Interception damage, and Enter the Game counter-strike output.</p>
              <p>If she is not in the rearmost position, the Black piece designation falls on a different unit (likely a support or tank), wasting the damage bonus and denying her the most important passive buff in her kit.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pos-card">
              <div class="pos-mode">Formation Structure</div>
              <p><strong>Front:</strong> Dedicated tank or bruiser -- receives the White piece designation (damage received reduced), ensuring the frontline survives longer to maintain board presence for Execute stance triggers.</p>
              <p><strong>Mid:</strong> Utility supports, energy accelerators, or CC heroes that extend fight duration and enable Jiutian's energy manipulation cycle.</p>
              <p><strong>Back:</strong> Jiutian Xuannv in the rearmost slot. Formation structure must be intentional -- random slot assignment breaks the entire White/Black designation system.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- COMPS -->
