                <strong>Active:</strong> Activates the farthest inactive device, expanding its area of effect. Allies inside recover HP and Energy per second; enemies inside have ATK Power and ATK Speed reduced. When all 3 devices are active, they <span class="highlight">merge into one field-wide device</span> -- immediately reducing all enemies' damage rate and boosting friendly damage rate and ATK Speed. Subsequent Ult casts also trigger this Fusion effect.
              </p>
              <div class="skill-upgrade-block">
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv2</span><span class="upgrade-text">HP and Energy recovered per second by allies inside activated devices increased.</span></div>
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv3</span><span class="upgrade-text">ATK Power and ATK Speed reduction on enemies inside devices increased.</span></div>
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv4</span><span class="upgrade-text">Fusion effect amplified: greater enemy damage rate reduction and higher friendly damage rate and ATK Speed boost.</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="skill-note">
                The engine of Hephaestus's entire kit. The passive deployment of 3 devices at battle start means he arrives with the infrastructure already in place -- each Ultimate cast is an activation, not a placement. Lv4 directly amplifies the Fusion payoff, making the third activation window significantly stronger.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="skill-card relic">
              <div class="skill-header">
                <img class="skill-icon" src="/skills/hephaestus_relic.png" alt="Undying Forge" />
                <span class="skill-name">Undying Forge</span>
