              <div class="skill-upgrade-block">
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv2</span><span class="upgrade-text">In Focus state: cooldowns of Weak Point Analysis and Force Field Shield reduced.</span></div>
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv3</span><span class="upgrade-text">In Focus state: Energy cost to cast Ultimate Domain reduced.</span></div>
                <div class="upgrade-row"><span class="skill-upgrade-level">Lv4</span><span class="upgrade-text">In Focus state: damage taken further reduced.</span></div>
