            <div class="mechanic-label" style="color: var(--gold-light);">Why Relic Investment Matters -- Competitive Breakpoints</div>
            <ul class="mechanic-list">
              <li><strong>Relic Lv1:</strong> Projection is active (6s duration, 50% ATK/HP) -- viable as a temporary allied copy, but the impact is limited without the CD refresh.</li>
              <li><strong>Relic Lv2 [Relic Lv.10]:</strong> Echo CD refresh on spawn -- the first genuine power spike. This is the minimum competitive investment level.</li>
              <li><strong>Relic Lv3 [Relic Lv.20]:</strong> Duration extended to 10s -- a substantial increase in the projection's active window.</li>
              <li><strong>Relic Lv4:</strong> Projection spawns with 1000 Energy -- the endgame breakpoint where Cronus transitions from strong support to a tempo-multiplying carry.</li>
              <li><strong>Relic Item -- Doctrine of Time</strong> (observed at Lv.18/35): HP +14.0%, ATK +11.2%, Armor +18.5%, M-RES +18.5%.</li>
              <li>Cronus's endgame identity depends on the Relic. Relic Lv2 (Lv.10) is the first competitive breakpoint. Relic Lv4 is the point where Cronus transitions from strong utility support to fight-warping tempo multiplier.</li>
